 PLC in Clinton County","/arc-plc/iowa/clinton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Clinton County runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 63% of normal and September to October ran 36%. June to July is the wettest pair at 8.83 inches, and it came in at 137% of normal in 2026 so far. Grid 26260 had its driest year in 1988 at 59%.</p>"}
